  "note": "Round 39, for Wheat on the image-free kit with the standalone Python. Eight direct Gemma 4 copies not yet measured, pinned from the unmeasured list by downloads and mixed by size class: tvall43/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-heretic, chulcher/gemma-4-e4b-abliterated, p-e-w/gemma-4-E4B-it-heretic-REPRODUCED-2, tvall43/gemma-4-E2B-it-heretic-v1, MoonRide/gemma-4-E2B-it-heretic-ara, Paul691/gemma-4-12B-it-abliterated-uncensored, MoonRide/gemma-4-E2B-it-heretic-ara-custom, NullpoLab/gemma-4-E4B-it-Heretic-ARA-Refusals8. The pinner refused six re-uploads of measured files (ScottzillaSystems E4B, benbird316 E2B, liham86 E4B, Ishowbackup 26B-A4B and AgentAnon E4B carry TrevorJS's or Jiunsong's files; Huy112200 E4B carries Himanshuoo8's, pinned in round 38), yeyuxx's 26B multimodal export whose names pair with nothing in the original, and TurkishCodeMan's E2B copy, a partial export of eighteen of thirty-five layers. OS-Software's CyberStag heretic is held: its parent is deer-sec's MLX export, whose names and split expert tensors need a recipe before they pair. Jiunsong's 26B multimodal copy and AgentAnon's 26B copy are gone from the hub. tvall43's E2B copy drops the original's 128 vision-encoder range scalars, listed apart as dropped_statistics."
